Ptan_zogitNTmxGT6VC_bgwGU-jAYoBXIWrWK3gO5mLw&oe=6AD0EDC4"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "467916352871409", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003282_467916356204742_1871921057092171900_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hUGMmn9zWBYQ7kNvwEdPHG8&_nc_oc=AdrZ8-BOg3FFM41cTYYqCVoPxBInugyadkXgVuPt9dBKn3d49o4YRS5ywCugkwqoADw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPcpXM0HB5Y3dBdGwpd6U_dAjnnmNVTv85OJT2pbkJh_w&oe=6AD0D262"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1934382610375855", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974473_1934382613709188_7156337812617042679_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3B4IWAK8k2oQ7kNvwFRl-DL&_nc_oc=Adok0QBsuiWvyutfEXA-vHGIFCX7Po-i1kQtDyjSzEa0T0LWyEdOF0xKE8otQli_kRA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMmaLWBObhyC7v-NWNO1g0lL7w0ktgvNBPLsy7mcabpMw&oe=6AD0F4B3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1524760081483769", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974531_1524760084817102_6497712644828891067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eyg-K22Kxc8Q7kNvwG_Yhd9&_nc_oc=Ado7cfsnShHs5OxoGqsFO1JyvzccI-7bFrBX4YvoHu5rMqdZrFG7ObzSGb61L8mhRKo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOz73Uu7r8mLm5tyhcLZVrO79m4Y3HkPKRqaDg7VOMqpg&oe=6AD0F3AF"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets", "keywords": [], "long_description": " AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "A VR escape room game where you have to solve intriguing riddles to open boxes and discover nice stories about popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "$R36BSY5.png", "id": "3678762505771822", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031430_3678762509105155_2151975047074617165_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Dlpu9UE1778Q7kNvwH-gWB8&_nc_oc=Adr6SKwJ41B3UicAeOmSmcu6bx9WGBo34X8V11qUXQKkV1oNfPreX2nWME3oPxPHZxA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPZmjPLPDmbe4LjbeeHbbtNVSpNscvmjjUpuHpdK_WPWA&oe=6AD0EFA5"}, {"file_name": "$R81V725.png", "id": "2720695481426567", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262743_2720695484759900_604086922326600035_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_yBDZjoD0xYQ7kNvwGlE4YJ&_nc_oc=AdriopL4BQS5C0is71Jd0IPOH__qpDTi4rMML4LiL1N8xBr5EhKQCty1BPJ-lPYNUKc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP-hSy2ymJVGCmlM_1PPT6FWMEC__pmgGfE6Zg5wDEeMQ&oe=6AD0EE8D"}, {"file_name": "$RQ3SN6U.png", "id": "1552311425628973", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982519_1552311428962306_1218130395049083834_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TqPYzj6IPcIQ7kNvwE2nWre&_nc_oc=AdpzL4AZTbAvkUMW69PqOERUmKNTauZj95JzkLx_6IyX0Mxgre6FOsq2DlyF6AimFpE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=